  <p>Games are licensed, not sold, for personal, non-commercial use. Purchases made through the App Store or Google Play are also governed by their terms. Paid unlocks are tied to the account you bought them with.</p>
  <h2>Live series</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Taking part is free and voluntary. One comment counts as one flag; we may ignore spam, automated, abusive or duplicate comments.</li>
    <li>By commenting you allow us to show your public handle and the country you named on the live map and in future episodes.</li>
    <li>The series is entertainment. Rankings have no monetary value, and we may change the rules, reset a season or end a series at any time.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Acceptable use</h2>
  <p>Don’t cheat, reverse-engineer, disrupt our services, or use them to harass anyone.</p>
